@baseUrl = http://localhost:5247

### Replace the sample report code, fight and name with a visible ranking row.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/warcraftlogs/reports/REPLACE_REPORT/timeline?fightId=1&playerName=REPLACE_PLAYER&edition=anniversary

### Known actor ID instead of a name
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/warcraftlogs/reports/REPLACE_REPORT/timeline?fightId=1&sourceId=7&edition=retail

### Real enemy casts and observed phase transitions for the reference fight
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/warcraftlogs/reports/N8v2dBGMZX6wrfaA/timeline/boss?fightId=106&edition=anniversary

### Invalid identity is rejected without contacting Warcraft Logs (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/warcraftlogs/reports/invalid/timeline?fightId=0&edition=anniversary

### Initial rankings include each complete timeline already available in the API file cache.
### Uncached timelines are omitted without requesting events from Warcraft Logs.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rankings/spec/retribution-paladin/illidan-stormrage?edition=anniversary&difficulty=normal&metric=dps
